{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  GS HEADER
  ==================================================================
  REBUILT, NOT PORTED. v3's sections/header.liquid is 107 KB and carries
  a retail store locator, an ADA compliance widget, a contact-us panel
  and a store-details dropdown layered onto one another over years.

  Structure:
      row 1   logo | search | icon row
      row 2   primary nav with mega menus

  The announcement bar is a separate section in header-group.json.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  HIGHLIGHTED NAV ITEM (the red BOGO 50% tab)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 drives this from theme settings, found in its settings_data.json:

      holiday_link_highlight_enable: true
      matching_holiday_link_text:    "BOGO 50%"
      holiday_link_bg_color:         "#ab192d"

  Matching is on the nav item's TITLE STRING, the same fragile pattern
  the mega menu images use - rename the item in the Shopify menu and the
  highlight silently stops applying. Kept deliberately so the existing
  configuration carries over, but it is worth knowing during a nav
  reshuffle.

  Those are theme settings in v3 and section settings here, because the
  Dawn settings_schema.json has no entries for them.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  MEGA MENU: MULTIPLE PROMO TILES PER NAV ITEM
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 supported ONE image per nav item. This renders EVERY nav_menu_img
  block whose menu_title matches, so a nav item can carry two or three
  tiles - a drop alongside a category - instead of one.

  Block type and setting ids are unchanged (menu_title, nav_image,
  nav_link), so v3's seven configured blocks migrate untouched and render
  as single tiles. `nav_label` is new and optional.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  HOVER ON DESKTOP, ACCESSIBLE DISCLOSURE EVERYWHERE
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Mega menus use <details>/<summary>: reachable by Tab, activated by
  Enter or Space, closed by Escape, expanded state announced.

  On desktop pointer devices (min-width 990px and hover: hover) the
  script below also opens a panel on mouseenter, and a click on the
  label navigates to the parent link's URL, as v3's <a> did. Touch
  devices and keyboard keep the click/Enter toggle, since a hover-only
  menu is unreachable there.

  CLOSE AND SWITCH RULES (2026-09-22). The first version closed a menu
  150ms after the pointer left its <details>, and the row was taller
  than the label (the highlighted tab sets the row height), so moving
  down into the panel crossed a strip that fired mouseleave - menus
  vanished on the way in. Now: the label stretches to the row (CSS), a
  menu closes only 200ms after the pointer leaves the whole nav (panel
  included), and while one menu is open another tab takes over only
  after the pointer has rested on it for 120ms, so a diagonal path into
  a panel that clips a neighbouring label no longer swaps menus.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  STICKY HEADER (2026-09-22)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  position: sticky lives on the SECTION WRAPPER (gs-header.css, via
  :has()), because the <header>'s own parent is exactly its height and
  gave it nowhere to stick. `sticky_header_type` mirrors v3: "on_scroll"
  hides the header while scrolling down past its own height and brings
  it back on the way up; "always" keeps it pinned. The script never
  hides it while a mega menu or the mobile nav is open or the search
  field has focus, and writes --gs-header-height on <body> for anchors
  (gs-club-join.css reads it).

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  ICON ROW (2026-10-05, client review)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Desktop, right-aligned, in block order: Accessibility | Customer
  service (headset) | Retail (pin) | app block (Swym favourites star) |
  Account | Cart. Mobile: the Icon link blocks marked "show on mobile",
  a search toggle that drops the field under the top row, Account,
  Cart. The accessibility icon is a <button class="acsb-trigger">,
  which accessiBe (assets/gs-accessibe.js, settings.enable_accessibe)
  binds as its opener, exactly as v3's header link worked. The @app
  block lets the Swym "Add to wishlist" header launcher be placed
  between Retail and Account from the editor rather than hardcoded.

  Still not carried over: the retail store locator dropdown, the
  contact-us side panel and the store details dropdown.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  ICON VISIBILITY (2026-10-20, client request)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Every icon has a "Show on" setting: All screen sizes / Desktop only /
  Mobile only (/ Hidden for account, cart, search). Desktop means
  990px and up, the header's own breakpoint. Icon link blocks gained
  `show_on`; the old `show_on_mobile` checkbox is kept for saved data
  (ticked + "Desktop only" behaves as before, i.e. all sizes) and is
  only shown in the editor while ticked. A hidden account icon stays in
  the DOM with display:none because Swym's wishlist launcher is
  injected beside .gs-header__account. `account_in_mobile_menu` adds an
  Account / Log in link to the bottom of the mobile menu.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-header.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  Critical rules, inline so they paint before gs-header.css (loaded here
  in the body) and Dawn's component-predictive-search.css arrive. Without
  them Safari painted the predictive-search spinner at the SVG default
  size (300x150) and the full search form on phones for a frame or two.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .predictive-search__loading-state { display: none; }
  .predictive-search__loading-state .spinner { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .gs-header__search { display: none; }
  }
</style>

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign menu = s.menu
  assign mega_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'nav_menu_img'

  # Show on: all / desktop / mobile / none -> icon class.
  # --desktop and --mobile are the classes gs-header.css already hides
  # below / above 990px; --hidden hides at every size.
  assign account_show = s.account_visibility | default: 'all'
  assign cart_show = s.cart_visibility | default: 'all'
  assign search_show = s.search_visibility | default: 'all'
  assign account_vis_class = ''
  case account_show
    when 'desktop'
      assign account_vis_class = ' gs-header__icon--desktop'
    when 'mobile'
      assign account_vis_class = ' gs-header__icon--mobile'
    when 'none'
      assign account_vis_class = ' gs-header__icon--hidden'
  endcase
  assign cart_vis_class = ''
  case cart_show
    when 'desktop'
      assign cart_vis_class = ' gs-header__icon--desktop'
    when 'mobile'
      assign cart_vis_class = ' gs-header__icon--mobile'
    when 'none'
      assign cart_vis_class = ' gs-header__icon--hidden'
  endcase

  # Precomputed once, outside the loop.
  assign highlight_match = ''
  if s.highlight_enable and s.highlight_text != blank
    assign highlight_match = s.highlight_text | downcase | strip
  endif
-%}

<header
  class="gs-header color-{{ s.color_scheme }}{% if s.sticky_header %} gs-header--sticky{% endif %}"
  {% if s.sticky_header %}data-gs-sticky="{{ s.sticky_header_type | default: 'on_scroll' }}"{% endif %}
  style="
    --gs-header-bg: {{ s.header_background | default: '#000000' }};
    --gs-header-text: {{ s.header_text | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --gs-header-hover: {{ s.header_text_hover | default: '#e7e7e7' }};
    --gs-header-icon: {{ s.header_icon | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --gs-cart-count-bg: {{ s.cart_count_background | default: '#ab192d' }};
    --gs-cart-count-text: {{ s.cart_count_text | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --gs-nav-bg: {{ s.nav_background | default: '#000000' }};
    --gs-mega-bg: {{ s.mega_background | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --gs-mega-text: {{ s.mega_text | default: '#121212' }};
    --gs-highlight-bg: {{ s.highlight_background | default: '#ab192d' }};
    --gs-highlight-text: {{ s.highlight_text_color | default: '#ffffff' }};
    --gs-logo-width: {{ s.logo_width | default: 180 }}px;
    --gs-logo-width-mobile: {{ s.logo_width_mobile | default: 130 }}px;
  "
>
{%- comment -%}
  Mobile: utility links marked "show on mobile" sit beside the burger, left
  of the crest, exactly where live (v3) puts the accessiBe icon. The
  right-hand icon row renders those same blocks desktop-only.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture gs_utils_mobile -%}
  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign util_show = block.settings.show_on | default: 'desktop'
      if util_show == 'desktop' and block.settings.show_on_mobile
        assign util_show = 'all'
      endif
    -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'utility_link' and util_show != 'desktop' -%}
      {%- capture icon_svg -%}
        {%- case block.settings.icon -%}
          {%- when 'accessibility' -%}
            {%- comment -%}v3 snippets/header-icons.liquid wheelchair glyph{%- endcomment -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M50.44,31.82c4.66,0,8.45-3.79,8.45-8.46s-3.79-8.46-8.45-8.46-8.46,3.79-8.46,8.46,3.79,8.46,8.46,8.46ZM50.44,18.14c2.87,0,5.21,2.34,5.21,5.22s-2.34,5.22-5.21,5.22-5.22-2.34-5.22-5.22,2.34-5.22,5.22-5.22Z"/><path d="M67.63,30.23h0c-11.54,3.37-23.73,3.38-35.26,0-2.55-.75-5.28.61-6.19,3.11-.49,1.34-.4,2.77.23,4.02.63,1.25,1.72,2.17,3.08,2.58,2.56.75,5.2,1.37,7.83,1.84,1.28.23,2.58.42,3.88.58-.04,2.86-.22,10.27-1.06,15.61-1.09,6.97-2.96,12.53-5.54,16.54-1.32,2.05-.99,4.74.78,6.41,1.1,1.04,2.59,1.55,4.08,1.36,1.49-.17,2.82-1,3.66-2.29,3.22-5,5.54-11.58,6.88-19.59,1.35,7.99,3.66,14.58,6.89,19.59.82,1.27,2.15,2.1,3.65,2.29.21.02.41.04.62.04,1.29,0,2.53-.49,3.47-1.39,1.76-1.67,2.09-4.36.78-6.41-2.58-3.99-4.44-9.56-5.54-16.54-.89-5.61-1.04-13.52-1.06-15.61,1.3-.16,2.6-.35,3.88-.58,2.64-.47,5.27-1.09,7.83-1.84,1.35-.4,2.44-1.32,3.07-2.58.64-1.28.72-2.71.23-4.02-.91-2.49-3.62-3.86-6.18-3.11ZM70.69,35.91c-.23.46-.61.78-1.09.92-2.44.72-4.96,1.31-7.48,1.76-1.38.24-2.8.45-4.18.61-1.35.14-2.37,1.28-2.37,2.65,0,1.02.08,10.11,1.1,16.62,1.17,7.43,3.2,13.42,6.02,17.79.47.74.35,1.71-.28,2.31-.4.38-.91.56-1.46.49-.55-.07-1.02-.36-1.32-.83-3.1-4.8-5.3-11.26-6.55-19.19-.15-1.01-.3-2.04-.42-3.09-.16-1.33-1.3-2.33-2.64-2.33s-2.48,1-2.64,2.34c-.12,1.04-.27,2.09-.42,3.08-1.25,7.94-3.46,14.4-6.54,19.19-.31.47-.79.77-1.32.83-.54.06-1.08-.12-1.48-.5-.64-.6-.75-1.56-.28-2.3,2.83-4.39,4.86-10.38,6.02-17.8.93-5.93,1.08-14.22,1.1-16.61.02-1.36-.99-2.51-2.35-2.67-1.41-.16-2.82-.37-4.2-.61-2.51-.45-5.03-1.04-7.47-1.75-.49-.15-.88-.48-1.11-.93-.23-.46-.26-.96-.08-1.45.33-.89,1.31-1.38,2.24-1.11,12.04,3.53,24.77,3.56,36.83.07l.24-.06c.92-.27,1.91.22,2.24,1.12.18.47.15.97-.09,1.45Z"/><path d="M50,0C22.43,0,0,22.43,0,50s22.43,50,50,50,50-22.43,50-50S77.57,0,50,0ZM50,91.9c-23.1,0-41.9-18.8-41.9-41.9S26.9,8.1,50,8.1s41.9,18.8,41.9,41.9-18.8,41.9-41.9,41.9Z"/></svg>
          {%- when 'headset' -%}
            {%- comment -%}v3 snippets/header-icons.liquid headset glyph{%- endcomment -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M98.83,70.42l-3.95-18.64s-.01-.05-.02-.07c-.35-1.59-1.27-2.94-2.51-3.91.04-.26.09-.52.13-.78l.02-.24c0-4.85-.83-9.51-2.33-13.86.97-.96,1.33-2.45.79-3.79C84.24,12.34,67.63,1.06,49.63,1.06S14.63,12.58,8.05,29.72c-.61,1.6.02,3.36,1.43,4.23-1.29,4.05-1.98,8.36-1.98,12.83l.17,1c-1.25.98-2.18,2.34-2.53,3.93,0,.02-.01.05-.02.07l-3.95,18.64c-.09.44-.17.88-.16,1.32.05,3.06,1.9,6.12,4.53,6.72,2.48.57,5.26.33,12.3,1.66,1.87.35,5.8-.77,7.48-2.08,1.84-1.44-.04-6.5-.62-8.33l-6-18.77c-1.18-3.69-2.43-6.22-6.1-5.04l-2.08.5s-.01,0-.02,0c.04-4.25.76-8.33,2.04-12.16.9-.34,1.67-1.04,2.04-2.01,5.55-14.46,19.63-24.17,35.04-24.17s29.17,9.51,34.84,23.67c.5,1.24,1.63,2.02,2.87,2.16,1.36,3.93,2.12,8.13,2.16,12.51,0,0-.01,0-.02,0l-2.08-.5c-3.67-1.17-4.92,1.35-6.1,5.04l-6,18.77c-.58,1.83-2.46,6.89-.62,8.33,1.23.97,3.69,1.82,5.64,2.07-.36.92-.71,1.8-1.04,2.63-1.69,4.19-4.88,9.18-10.46,9.18l-9.98-.12h-.02v-.24c0-2.15-1.76-3.92-3.92-3.92h-10.78c-2.15,0-3.92,1.76-3.92,3.92v3.47c0,2.15,1.76,3.92,3.92,3.92h10.78c2.15,0,3.92-1.76,3.92-3.92v-.24l9.98.12c5.75,0,10.34-3.82,13.25-11.06.49-1.23,1.02-2.57,1.57-4.01,5.96-1.03,8.52-.87,10.82-1.39,2.63-.6,4.49-3.66,4.53-6.72,0-.45-.07-.89-.16-1.32Z"/></svg>
          {%- when 'help' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
              <path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 115 .5c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1" fill="currentColor"/>
            </svg>
          {%- when 'pin' -%}
            {%- comment -%}v3 snippets/header-icons.liquid retail-store pin glyph{%- endcomment -%}
            <svg viewBox="-16 0 100 100" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M34.02,0C15.26,0,0,15.26,0,34.03c0,23.95,15.67,50.03,31.14,63.41l2.97,2.57,2.89-2.66c12.48-11.47,31.04-37.79,31.04-63.32C68.05,15.26,52.78,0,34.02,0ZM33.94,88.03c-12.68-12.48-25.13-34.45-25.13-54,0-13.9,11.31-25.22,25.21-25.22s25.22,11.31,25.22,25.22c0,18.67-12.55,40.88-25.3,54Z"/><path d="M34.02,20.33c-8.52,0-15.46,6.93-15.46,15.46s6.93,15.46,15.46,15.46,15.46-6.93,15.46-15.46-6.93-15.46-15.46-15.46ZM34.02,47.72c-6.58,0-11.93-5.35-11.93-11.93s5.35-11.93,11.93-11.93,11.93,5.35,11.93,11.93-5.35,11.93-11.93,11.93Z"/></svg>
          {%- else -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M12 2l2.9 6.3 6.9.8-5 4.7 1.3 6.8L12 17.4 5.9 20.6 7.2 13.8l-5-4.7 6.9-.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- if block.settings.behaviour == 'accessibility' -%}
        <button type="button" class="gs-header__icon gs-header__icon--mobile-util acsb-trigger" aria-label="{{ block.settings.label | escape }}">
          {{ icon_svg }}
        </button>
      {%- elsif block.settings.link != blank -%}
        <a class="gs-header__icon gs-header__icon--mobile-util" href="{{ block.settings.link }}" aria-label="{{ block.settings.label | escape }}">
          {{ icon_svg }}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

  <div class="gs-header__main">
    <div class="page-width gs-header__main-inner">

      <button
        type="button"
        class="gs-header__burger"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="GsMobileNav"
        aria-label="{{ 'sections.header.menu' | t }}"
        data-gs-nav-toggle
      >
        <span class="gs-header__burger-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="gs-header__burger-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="gs-header__burger-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </button>

      {%- if gs_utils_mobile != blank -%}
        <div class="gs-header__mobile-utils">{{ gs_utils_mobile }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="gs-header__logo">
        {%- if request.page_type == 'index' -%}
          <h1 class="gs-header__logo-heading">
        {%- endif -%}
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="gs-header__logo-link" aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }}">
          {%- if s.logo != blank -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Mobile (< 990px) swaps in the stacked crest when one is set, as the
              live v3 header does; the wide wordmark does not fit between the
              burger and the icon row at phone widths.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <picture>
              {%- if s.logo_mobile != blank -%}
                <source
                  media="(max-width: 989px)"
                  srcset="{{ s.logo_mobile | image_url: width: 200 }} 200w, {{ s.logo_mobile | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w"
                  sizes="{{ s.logo_width_mobile | default: 130 }}px"
                  width="{{ s.logo_mobile.width }}"
                  height="{{ s.logo_mobile.height }}"
                >
              {%- endif -%}
              <img
                src="{{ s.logo | image_url: width: 400 }}"
                srcset="{{ s.logo | image_url: width: 200 }} 200w, {{ s.logo | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w"
                sizes="(max-width: 989px) {{ s.logo_width_mobile | default: 130 }}px, {{ s.logo_width }}px"
                alt="{{ s.logo.alt | escape | default: shop.name | escape }}"
                width="{{ s.logo.width }}"
                height="{{ s.logo.height }}"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
              >
            </picture>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="gs-header__logo-text">{{ shop.name }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </a>
        {%- if request.page_type == 'index' -%}
          </h1>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if s.show_search and search_show != 'none' -%}
        <div class="gs-header__search{% if search_show == 'mobile' %} gs-header__search--mobile-only{% endif %}" id="GsHeaderSearchWrap-{{ section.id }}">
          {%- if settings.predictive_search_enabled -%}
            <predictive-search data-loading-text="{{ 'accessibility.loading' | t }}">
          {%- endif -%}
            <form action="{{ routes.search_url }}" method="get" role="search" class="gs-header__search-form">
              <label class="visually-hidden" for="GsHeaderSearch-{{ section.id }}">
                {{ 'general.search.search' | t }}
              </label>
              <svg class="gs-header__search-icon" viewBox="0 0 18 19" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M11.03 11.68A5.784 5.784 0 112.85 3.5a5.784 5.784 0 018.18 8.18zm.26 1.12a6.78 6.78 0 11.72-.72l5.4 5.4a.5.5 0 01-.71.7l-5.41-5.38z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              <input
                id="GsHeaderSearch-{{ section.id }}"
                class="gs-header__search-input"
                type="search"
                name="q"
                value="{{ search.terms | escape }}"
                placeholder="{{ s.search_placeholder | escape }}"
                {%- if settings.predictive_search_enabled -%}
                  role="combobox"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                  aria-owns="GsPredictiveResults-{{ section.id }}"
                  aria-controls="GsPredictiveResults-{{ section.id }}"
                  aria-haspopup="listbox"
                  aria-autocomplete="list"
                  autocorrect="off"
                  autocomplete="off"
                  autocapitalize="off"
                  spellcheck="false"
                {%- endif -%}
              >
              <input type="hidden" name="options[prefix]" value="last">

              <button type="reset" class="gs-header__search-reset" aria-label="{{ 'general.search.reset' | t }}">
                {{ 'general.search.reset' | t }}
              </button>

              <button type="submit" class="gs-header__search-submit" aria-label="{{ 'general.search.search' | t }}">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                  <path d="M5 12h13M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </button>

              {%- if settings.predictive_search_enabled -%}
                <div class="gs-header__predictive" tabindex="-1" data-predictive-search>
                  <div class="predictive-search__loading-state">
                    <svg class="spinner" viewBox="0 0 66 66" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                      <circle class="path" fill="none" stroke-width="6" cx="33" cy="33" r="30"></circle>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </form>
          {%- if settings.predictive_search_enabled -%}
            </predictive-search>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Icon row. Order is the block order in the editor: on the live
        site that is Accessibility | Customer service | Retail | (Swym
        star app block) | then the fixed Account | Cart. Mobile shows
        the links marked "show on mobile", the search toggle, account
        and cart (gs-header.css hides the rest below 990px).
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="gs-header__icons">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- case block.type -%}
            {%- when '@app' -%}
              <div class="gs-header__icon gs-header__icon--app" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                {%- render block -%}
              </div>

            {%- when 'utility_link' -%}
              {%- liquid
                # Desktop-only in this row: on mobile the block renders
